#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:2
msgid "Custom script"
msgstr "自定义脚本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Custom Script addon allows you to inject a custom JavaScript file into "
"your documentation at serve time. This enables you to modify or enhance "
"frozen documentation without rebuilding it."
msgstr "自定义脚本 addon 允许你在提供服务时向文档注入自定义 JavaScript 文件，从而无需重新构建即可修改或增强已冻结的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:8
msgid "Configure custom scripts"
msgstr "配置自定义脚本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:10
msgid "To add or update a custom script for your project:"
msgstr "为项目添加或更新自定义脚本："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:12
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Custom script`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Custom script` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:13
msgid "Enter the URL of your JavaScript file in the :guilabel:`Source URL` field."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Source URL` 字段中填入 JavaScript 文件的 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:14
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:17
msgid "Using custom scripts"
msgstr "使用自定义脚本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:19
msgid ""
"This addon allows specifying a URL to a JavaScript file that will be "
"injected into all pages of your documentation. The script can be hosted on "
"Read the Docs itself (as a relative URL) or on an external server (as an "
"absolute URL)."
msgstr ""
"此 addon 允许指定一个 JavaScript 文件 URL，该文件会被注入你文档的所有页面。脚本可托管在 Read the Docs 自身（相对 "
"URL）或外部服务器（绝对 URL）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:22
msgid "Common use cases for custom scripts include:"
msgstr "自定义脚本的常见用例包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:24
msgid "Fixing bugs or adding features to frozen documentation"
msgstr "修复已冻结文档的缺陷或为其添加功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:25
msgid "Injecting analytics or tracking code"
msgstr "注入分析或追踪代码"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:26
msgid "Customizing the appearance or behavior of specific documentation versions"
msgstr "定制特定文档版本的外观或行为"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:29
msgid "Accessing Addons data from your script"
msgstr "从脚本访问 Addon 数据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:31
msgid ""
"Custom scripts are loaded asynchronously after the initial page load, which "
"means the ``readthedocs-addons-data-ready`` event has already been fired by "
"the time your script executes. To access the Addons data from your custom "
"script, check the ``window.ReadTheDocsEventData`` object first, then "
"subscribe to the event for future updates (for example, when the URL changes"
" in a single-page application):"
msgstr ""
"自定义脚本在页面初次加载后异步加载，因此脚本执行时 ``readthedocs-addons-data-ready`` 事件已经触发。要从自定义脚本访问"
" Addon 数据，请先检查 ``window.ReadTheDocsEventData`` 对象，再订阅该事件以获取后续更新（例如单页应用中 URL "
"变化时）："

